@startuml
[*] --> Idle

Idle : entry / nil
Idle : do / display current time
Idle : exit / waiting for user input

Idle --> PowerSelection : user interaction

PowerSelection : entry / waiting for user input
PowerSelection : do / choose power level (full/half)
PowerSelection : exit / power level selected

PowerSelection --> TimeSetting : power level selected

TimeSetting : entry / power level selected
TimeSetting : do / enter cooking time
TimeSetting : exit / cooking time set

TimeSetting --> Cooking : time set

Cooking : entry / cooking time set
Cooking : do / microwave operation
Cooking : exit / cooking complete

Cooking --> DoorOpen : door opened

DoorOpen : entry / cooking
DoorOpen : do / stop operation
DoorOpen : exit / door open

DoorOpen --> Idle : door closed

Cooking --> Cancel : user cancels

Cancel : entry / cooking
Cancel : do / stop operation
Cancel --> Idle

Cooking --> CookingComplete : cooking finished

CookingComplete : entry / cooking
CookingComplete : do / beep
CookingComplete : exit / cooking finished

CookingComplete --> Idle

Idle --> [*]
@enduml
